      "q": "How much does Minburn Technology Group make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Minburn Technology Group has $767M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Minburn Technology Group has 453 awards this fiscal year to date and an average award size of $1.7M. Minburn Technology Group obligations are down 18.9% year over year."
